# Phase 5 transcript research: one tool group in full-access mode -- a long
# command (wider than 120 columns, running 12 s) and five reads in one step,
# then two subagents (the `request` wrapper both binaries accept,
# df0878eb), then the answer. Ctrl-O while the command runs (the long row
# clipped on c1db919, wrapped under the rail on v0.0.16, 427d481f), a page up,
# and the same view after the command settles and the page rebuilds
# (026a8f4e/b1a53b01). The group header counts subagents (8625c8f6).
gateway p5-transcript-tools-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-transcript-ws
wait 4
type check the files
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap running
key C-o
wait 2
snap full-running
key PPage
wait 1
snap full-pgup
wait 14
snap full-pgup-after
key C-o
wait 1
snap end
snapfull end
key C-o
wait 2
snap full-tail
key Up Up Up Up
wait 1
snap full-tail-up4
key C-o
wait 1
gwlog
